@startuml AD-5
!include _style.iuml
title AD-5 (System level) — Get station suggestion\nTrigger: Driver opens "Suggested for You" · Use cases: UC-CHG-07, UC-CHG-01 · Rules: BR-P32, BR-P33, BR-P39, BR-P41

|«person»\nDriver|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
|«external system»\nMap & Routing\nService|
|«person»\nDriver|
start
:Enter battery % and target charge\n(default 80%, at most 80%) and share\nlocation (optional);
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
:Estimate range = rated range\n× battery % × 0.75;
:Find stations compatible with the\nvehicle within 1.5 × estimated range;
if ( ) then ([BR-P33: nothing in range])
  :Take the 3 nearest compatible\nstations, marked risky;
else ([candidates found])
endif
:Label each station by reach: ok, tight\nor risky (10 km reserve; road = straight\nline × 1.3, 30 km/h), nothing dropped;
:Estimate wait by connector status\n(free 0, freeing soon 5, in use 30 min);
:Estimate charging time to target\n(85% efficiency) and the cost at\nthe highest tariff of the day;
:BR-P41: rank by reach, then total time\n(drive + wait + charge), then distance;
note right
  Stations with no estimate (e.g. status
  out of date) are listed last.
  Cheapest mode, reliability penalty and
  session-based wait: planned after the MVP.
end note
:Keep the top three and show them\nwith reasons (drive, wait, time, cost);
|«person»\nDriver|
if ( ) then ([Driver taps Navigate])
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  :Request the road route\nto the chosen station>
  |«external system»\nMap & Routing\nService|
  :Return route (Vietmap)>
  |«person»\nDriver|
  :Open navigation to\nthe chosen station;
  stop
else ([else])
  if ( ) then ([Driver taps Reserve on an\nAvailable connector (Should)])
    :Reserve a charging\nconnector ⋔ (AD-4);
    stop
  else ([Driver leaves the list])
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml
